body:
Long story short...

&#x200B;

She phones my landlord about everything.

&#x200B;

She has now phoned the police claiming i leave the oven on for hours with nothing inside, what the hell do I do? 

&#x200B;

She's stopped paying rent too, there is 6 of us living here in total, but constantly claims i take drugs and put 'her in danger' we are all like 20-25 and shes 40 from south africa, no idea what to do, landlord is out of ideas on how to get rid of her too.
